# `text=lf` is invalid (the text attribute has no 'lf' value; EOL is set via eol=).
# It silently applied nothing, so on Windows runners (autocrlf=true) files checked out
# as CRLF and IDE0055 flagged them against .editorconfig's end_of_line=lf. Force LF on
# checkout for all text files on every platform:
* text=auto eol=lf
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.png binary
*.scene binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
